{%- comment -%}
  The toneScan landing pages' repeated call to action, in two places:
    place: blank   the site header (sections/header.liquid, landing templates only), 990px and up
    place: 'bar'   the fixed bar at the bottom of the screen below 990px (layout/tonescan.liquid)
  Both stay out of sight while the hero, which has its own, is on screen; the bar also steps
  aside while the closing section's form (#join, or #signup on toneScan) is on screen (script in
  layout/tonescan.liquid).

  toneLight: the Kickstarter button, or the Kit waitlist form, per Theme settings > toneLight
  Kickstarter > Call to action. In the header the form is compact, and below 1200px a button to
  the form in the closing section (#join) stands in, since the bar has no room for a form. The
  other variant rides along in an inert <template> for the development panel's preview switch.
  toneScan: the beta signup form, the same form and script as the hero's (tonescan-scripts wires
  every .ts-signup). Compact in the header from 1200px; between 990 and 1199px a button to the
  closing signup section (#signup) stands in; full width in the bar.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign in_bar = false -%}
{%- if place == 'bar' -%}{%- assign in_bar = true -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if template.suffix contains 'tonelight' -%}
  {%- assign tl_cta = settings.tonelight_cta | default: 'link' -%}
  {%- capture tl_link -%}<a href="{{ settings.tonelight_ks_url | default: '#rewards' }}" class="ts-cta ts-cta--ks{% unless in_bar %} ts-cta--sm{% endunless %}">Back on Kickstarter</a>{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- if in_bar -%}
    {%- capture tl_kit -%}{% render 'ts-kit-form', label: settings.tonelight_kit_label, class: 'ts-kit--bar' %}{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- capture tl_kit -%}<div class="ts-head-kit">{% render 'ts-kit-form', label: settings.tonelight_kit_label, class: 'ts-kit--header' %}</div><a href="#join" class="ts-cta ts-cta--ks ts-cta--sm ts-head-kit__btn">{{ settings.tonelight_kit_label | default: 'Join the waitlist' }}</a>{%- endcapture -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  <div class="{% if in_bar %}ts-cta-bar__inner{% else %}ts-head-cta{% endif %} ts-cta-swap" data-cta="{{ tl_cta }}">
    <div class="ts-cta-swap__on">{% if tl_cta == 'kit' %}{{ tl_kit }}{% else %}{{ tl_link }}{% endif %}</div>
    {%- if tl_cta == 'kit' -%}<template data-cta-alt="link">{{ tl_link }}</template>{%- else -%}<template data-cta-alt="kit">{{ tl_kit }}</template>{%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- elsif template.suffix contains 'tonescan' -%}
  {%- capture ts_form -%}
    <div class="ts-signup ts-signup--{% if in_bar %}bar{% else %}header{% endif %}">
      <form class="ts-form" novalidate>
        <input class="ts-email" type="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" aria-label="Email address">
        <button class="ts-btn" type="submit">Join the beta</button>
      </form>
      <p class="ts-msg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  {%- endcapture -%}
  <div class="{% if in_bar %}ts-cta-bar__inner{% else %}ts-head-cta{% endif %}">
    {%- if in_bar -%}
      {{ ts_form }}
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="ts-head-kit">{{ ts_form }}</div><a href="#signup" class="ts-cta ts-cta--accent ts-cta--sm ts-head-kit__btn">Join the beta</a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
